                                "sense_id": "19cbfb47-91a1-36de-93fc-924ce86bbcef",
                                "text": "So-called uninsurables are a rapidly diminishing group, according to the Institute of Life Insurance. Persons who cannot qualify for life insurance are becoming fewer every year, the organization said yesterday."
